{"book":"proverbs","num":9,"verses":[{"en":"Wisdom hath builded her house, she hath hewn out her seven pillars:","n":1,"sm":"O le tu a le ua valea O le poto ua faia e ia lona fale; ua ia talai ona pou e fitu.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"tu"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"valea"},{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"poto"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"faia"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"lona"},{"en":"","sm":"fale;"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"talai"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"pou"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"fitu."}]},{"en":"She hath killed her beasts; she hath mingled her wine; she hath also furnished her table.","n":2,"sm":"Ua na fasia ana manu; ua na suia lana uaina; ua na laulau atu foi mea i lana laoai.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"","sm":"na"},{"en":"","sm":"fasia"},{"en":"","sm":"ana"},{"en":"","sm":"manu;"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"na"},{"en":"","sm":"suia"},{"en":"","sm":"lana"},{"en":"","sm":"uaina;"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"na"},{"en":"","sm":"laulau"},{"en":"","sm":"atu"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"mea"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"lana"},{"en":"","sm":"laoai."}]},{"en":"She hath sent forth her maidens: she crieth upon the highest places of the city,","n":3,"sm":"Ua ia awna atu lona galu teine; ua tala'i i mea maualuluza o le aai,","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"awna"},{"en":"","sm":"atu"},{"en":"","sm":"lona"},{"en":"","sm":"galu"},{"en":"","sm":"teine;"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"tala'i"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"mea"},{"en":"","sm":"maualuluza"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"aai,"}]},{"en":"Whoso is simple, let him turn in hither: as for him that wanteth understanding, she saith to him,","n":4,"sm":"Ai se faigofie, :a afe mai o ia iinei; o le ua leai sona mafaufau, ua ia faapea